{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/624a48a9f500a2f9ddc2257801e20fe8.webp?t=1770318564\" width=617 height=57 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you reach the top?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chick That Never Skipped a Leg Day is a 3D precision climb where <strong>every mistake costs height</strong>. One goal: reach the <strong>Golden Leg Press</strong>. Learn the routes, keep your composure, and turn brutal sections into muscle memory.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/517fb009b674c95be81af188961abfea.poster.avif?t=1770318564\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/517fb009b674c95be81af188961abfea.webm?t=1770318564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/517fb009b674c95be81af188961abfea.mp4?t=1770318564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two modes, same climb</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Hardcore Climb:</strong> no safety net. The pure run (ideal for Time Attack and leaderboards)<br></li><li><strong>Checkpoint Mode:</strong> optional checkpoints so mixed-skill groups can still climb together</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A clean look for a brutal climb</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Stylized visuals for <strong>clarity</strong>: read jumps and routes at a glance<br></li><li>Built to keep performance stable on a <strong>huge vertical map</strong> and lower-end PCs</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for precision (and momentum)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tight, responsive movement tuned for exact landings<br></li><li>Momentum-forward flow: clean jumps feel fast and satisfying<br></li><li>Readable setups: you see the line, then you commit</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Routes, shortcuts, and risk</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple lines through sections: <strong>safe routes</strong> vs <strong>faster, riskier shortcuts</strong><br></li><li>High-reward paths demand consistency, not luck</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/09f365c8210bc5855747793b1e183779.poster.avif?t=1770318564\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/09f365c8210bc5855747793b1e183779.webm?t=1770318564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/09f365c8210bc5855747793b1e183779.mp4?t=1770318564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or online</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solo: the climb, the nerves, the summit<br></li><li>Online: climb together or race side-by-side for bragging rights</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Attack &amp; mastery</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Chase better times by choosing smarter lines<br></li><li>Replay for cleaner execution and faster splits</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A climb with personality</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cute presentation, ruthless platforming<br></li><li>Secrets and easter eggs for explorers and spectators<br></li><li>Retro-tech details and skyline vibes</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save to your Wishlist</strong> to get notified when Chick That Never Skipped a Leg Day launches.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2985280?t=1770318564","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/c94885aeb80f74c3784ba6f351390b654a94ccef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770318564","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/